msgid "Getting Your FedEx API Credentials"
msgstr "Получение учетных данных API FedEx"

#: components_data/integrations/shipping_provider/fedex/v1.1.0/setup_instructions.html:8
#: components_data/integrations/shipping_provider/fedex/v1.1.1/setup_instructions.html:8
msgid ""
"Follow these steps to set up your FedEx developer account and obtain API "
"credentials"
msgstr ""
"Следуйте этим шагам, чтобы настроить ваш разработчикский аккаунт FedEx и "
"получить учетные данные API."

#: components_data/integrations/shipping_provider/fedex/v1.1.0/setup_instructions.html:16
#: components_data/integrations/shipping_provider/fedex/v1.1.1/setup_instructions.html:16
msgid "Create a FedEx Developer Account"
msgstr "Создать учетную запись разработчика FedEx"

#: components_data/integrations/shipping_provider/fedex/v1.1.0/setup_instructions.html:17
#: components_data/integrations/shipping_provider/fedex/v1.1.1/setup_instructions.html:17
msgid ""
"Visit the FedEx Developer Portal and sign up for a free developer account."
msgstr ""
"Посетите портал разработчиков FedEx и зарегистрируйтесь на бесплатный "
"разработчикский аккаунт."

#: components_data/integrations/shipping_provider/fedex/v1.1.0/setup_instructions.html:23
#: components_data/integrations/shipping_provider/fedex/v1.1.1/setup_instructions.html:23
msgid "Open FedEx Developer Portal"
msgstr "Открыть портал разработчика FedEx"

#: components_data/integrations/shipping_provider/fedex/v1.1.0/setup_instructions.html:27
#: components_data/integrations/shipping_provider/fedex/v1.1.1/setup_instructions.html:27
msgid "You'll need a valid email address and basic business information."
msgstr ""
"Вам понадобится действующий адрес электронной почты и базовая информация о "
"бизнесе."

#: components_data/integrations/shipping_provider/fedex/v1.1.0/setup_instructions.html:35
#: components_data/integrations/shipping_provider/fedex/v1.1.1/setup_instructions.html:35
msgid "Create a New Project"
msgstr "Создать новый проект"

#: components_data/integrations/shipping_provider/fedex/v1.1.0/setup_instructions.html:38
#: components_data/integrations/shipping_provider/fedex/v1.1.1/setup_instructions.html:38
msgid "Click 'Create New Project' or navigate to 'My Projects'"
msgstr "Нажмите 'Создать новый проект' или перейдите в 'Мои проекты'."

#: components_data/integrations/shipping_provider/fedex/v1.1.0/setup_instructions.html:39
#: components_data/integrations/shipping_provider/fedex/v1.1.1/setup_instructions.html:39
msgid ""
"Give your project a descriptive name (e.g., 'My Store Shipping Integration')"
msgstr ""
"Дайте своему проекту описательное имя (например, 'Интеграция доставки моего "
"магазина')."

#: components_data/integrations/shipping_provider/fedex/v1.1.0/setup_instructions.html:40
#: components_data/integrations/shipping_provider/fedex/v1.1.1/setup_instructions.html:40
msgid "Select the APIs you need (at minimum: Ship, Track, Rates)"
msgstr "Выберите необходимые API (минимум: Ship, Track, Rates)."

#: components_data/integrations/shipping_provider/fedex/v1.1.0/setup_instructions.html:41
#: components_data/integrations/shipping_provider/fedex/v1.1.1/setup_instructions.html:41
msgid "Accept the terms of service"
msgstr "Принять условия использования"

#: components_data/integrations/shipping_provider/fedex/v1.1.0/setup_instructions.html:49
#: components_data/integrations/shipping_provider/fedex/v1.1.1/setup_instructions.html:49
msgid "Generate API Credentials"
msgstr "Создать учетные данные API"

#: components_data/integrations/shipping_provider/fedex/v1.1.0/setup_instructions.html:50
#: components_data/integrations/shipping_provider/fedex/v1.1.1/setup_instructions.html:50
msgid "In your project dashboard:"
msgstr "В вашем дашборде проекта:"

#: components_data/integrations/shipping_provider/fedex/v1.1.0/setup_instructions.html:52
#: components_data/integrations/shipping_provider/fedex/v1.1.1/setup_instructions.html:52
msgid "Navigate to 'API Credentials' or 'Keys & Secrets'"
msgstr "Перейдите в 'Учетные данные API' или 'Ключи и секреты'."

#: components_data/integrations/shipping_provider/fedex/v1.1.0/setup_instructions.html:53
#: components_data/integrations/shipping_provider/fedex/v1.1.1/setup_instructions.html:53
msgid "Click 'Generate New Credentials' or 'Create API Key'"
msgstr "Нажмите 'Создать новые учетные данные' или 'Создать API-ключ'."

#: components_data/integrations/shipping_provider/fedex/v1.1.0/setup_instructions.html:54
#: components_data/integrations/shipping_provider/fedex/v1.1.1/setup_instructions.html:54
msgid "You will receive an API Key (Client ID) and API Secret (Client Secret)"
msgstr "Вы получите API-ключ (Client ID) и API-секрет (Client Secret)."

#: components_data/integrations/shipping_provider/fedex/v1.1.0/setup_instructions.html:55
#: components_data/integrations/shipping_provider/fedex/v1.1.1/setup_instructions.html:55
msgid "Copy both values immediately - you'll need them in the next step"
msgstr "Сразу скопируйте оба значения — они понадобятся на следующем этапе."

#: components_data/integrations/shipping_provider/fedex/v1.1.0/setup_instructions.html:59
#: components_data/integrations/shipping_provider/fedex/v1.1.1/setup_instructions.html:59
#: components_data/integrations/shipping_provider/ups/v1.0.0/setup_instructions.html:78
#: components_data/integrations/shipping_provider/ups/v1.0.1/setup_instructions.html:78
msgid "Important!"
msgstr "Важно!"

#: components_data/integrations/shipping_provider/fedex/v1.1.0/setup_instructions.html:60
#: components_data/integrations/shipping_provider/fedex/v1.1.1/setup_instructions.html:60
msgid ""
"FedEx will only show your API Secret once. Make sure to save it securely "
"before closing the page."
msgstr ""
"FedEx покажет ваш API-секрет только один раз. Убедитесь, что вы сохранили "
"его безопасно перед закрытием страницы."

#: components_data/integrations/shipping_provider/fedex/v1.1.0/setup_instructions.html:68
#: components_data/integrations/shipping_provider/fedex/v1.1.1/setup_instructions.html:68
